eck and aim part\n\n- **Auto Hit**: swings your melee at anything in reach\n\n- **Kill Aura**: hits every mob around you, in any direction\n\n- **Gun Aura**: automatically shoots the closest mob in clear view\n\n- **Train Kill Aura**: takes out anything that gets near your train\n\n- **Smart Weapon Switch**: always holds the gun or melee that can actually do damage\n\n\n\n## Farming & Automation\n\n- **Auto Bond Farm**: drives the train and collects every bond along the way\n\n- **Loop Runs**: when a run ends, returns to the lobby, starts a new solo party and farms again\n\n- **Auto Farm**: loots valuables into your sack and sells them at every town\n\n- **Auto Collect / Auto Sack / Grab Money Bags**\n\n- **Auto Sell**: empties your sack at any counter\n\n- **Auto Fuel Train**: burns junk and buys coal when you run low\n\n- **Auto Drive Train**\n\n- **Auto Heal**: uses snake oil and bandages when your health drops\n\n- **Safety System**: retreats to the train when hurt or swarmed, and plays it safe at night\n\n\n\n## Visuals\n\n- **Player ESP / NPC ESP / Mob ESP**: name, health and distance\n\n- **Fullbright**\n\n- **Light Sphere**\n\n\n\n## Movement & Teleports\n\n- **Noclip**\n\n- **Fly (Chair)** *(beta)*\n\n- **Teleports**: Train, Horse, every Town, Sterling, Stillwater Prison, Tesla Lab, Merchants, Forts and Outposts\n\n\n\n## Utilities\n\n- **Bring Items**: valuables, guns, ammo, medical, armor, fuel and explosives\n\n- **Bring Cannon**: to you or to your train\n\n- **Instant Interact**\n\n- **Bank Codes Reveal**: finds the vault combo pieces and notes\n\n- **Unlock Camera**: third person with free zoom\n\n- **Draggable Panel**: live money, bonds, fuel, speed and sack\n\n\n\nClean interface | Settings save automatically | Mobile support","tags":["Dead Rails","Auto bounty","Undetected","Popular","Auto farm"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/yJbc5te4Xj","keyLink":"https://discord.gg/yJbc5te4Xj","owner":{"_id":"6930737bf0170c0a5193fd1c","username":"Pearl_scripts","ve